## 🔀 Fan-out points (parallelism — Philosophy 2)
Express concurrency *here*, at the seams, not as per-agent bookkeeping:

```
{{ASCII: which steps run in parallel once they unblock}}
e.g.  after script-ready ──┬─▶ structure
                           ├─▶ metadata        (independent → fan out at once)
                           └─▶ thumbnail
      structure ──▶ scene prompts ──▶ [scene 1..N images]   (homogeneous → batch, M in flight)
```

- **Independent steps** that unblock together → dispatch in one message.
- **Homogeneous batches** (N scenes / N pages) → run M concurrently, not all-or-one.

