## 🔁 Reflection loops (both close here)
- **Loop A — per-cycle:** the final step writes a dated note to `reflections/`
  (permanent; never inside a build dir that gets cleaned).
- **Loop B — cross-session:** `/finalize-session` rewrites `NEXT_SESSION.md`;
  scheduled jobs drop analytics into `reports/`, which the next `/start-session` consumes.
> Detailed reflection procedure → `documentation/playbooks/reflection_playbook.md`.

